{"title":"Fishing Trainer","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Fishing Trainer is a trainer — a named <a href=\"#/monster/human\">Human</a> seen at level 1.</p>\n      <h2>Wearing</h2><p>The <a href=\"#/guide/outfits\">Fisherman</a> outfit, and</p><div class=\"gear-line\"><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>head</i> Oilskin Hat</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>torso</i> Oilskin Coat</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>legs</i> Waders</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>feet</i> Wading Boots</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>off hand</i> Gold Fishing Rod</span></div>\n      <h2>Quests</h2><p class=\"muted\">Fishing Trainer has quests to give; none has been recorded yet.</p>\n      <h2>Where to find Fishing Trainer</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>Plymouth Wharf - Fishing Trainer</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 6×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"20\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"fishing-trainer\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Other named Humans</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/binxonia-guard\">Binxonia Guard</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/banker\">Banker</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/mira\">Mira</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/james-hookman\">James Hookman</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/harbormaster-orla-quayle\">Harbormaster Orla Quayle</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/nessa-holt\">Nessa Holt</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/stablemaster\">Stablemaster</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/mining-trainer\">Mining Trainer</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/ada-fen\">Ada Fen</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/hollis-tamber\">Hollis Tamber</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/lumberjack-trainer\">Lumberjack Trainer</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/exchange-clerk\">Exchange Clerk</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/gerald-seabroden\">Gerald Seabroden</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/osric-blane\">Osric Blane</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/ellis-pike\">Ellis Pike</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/bloomguard-archer\">Bloomguard Archer</a> · <a href=\"